\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Study workflow. Raw Planica jump and wind records pass through file-level quality screening, temporal resampling, feature construction, and zone-wise wind aggregation. Ridge regression estimates the state transition and control matrices. Jump-level cross-validation evaluates held-out trajectories, while a final fit is exported as versioned JSON (JavaScript Object Notation) for the client-side website.}}{2}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:architecture}{{1}{2}{Study workflow. Raw Planica jump and wind records pass through file-level quality screening, temporal resampling, feature construction, and zone-wise wind aggregation. Ridge regression estimates the state transition and control matrices. Jump-level cross-validation evaluates held-out trajectories, while a final fit is exported as versioned JSON (JavaScript Object Notation) for the client-side website}{figure.1}{}}
