\newlabel{fig:matrices}{{2}{6}{Dimensions and information flow of the fitted linear state-space model. Trajectories are generated recursively with the state equation. The observation equation is included to specify the complete fitted system. In the article we depict state $h(t)$ as $x_k$, control $u(t)$ as $u_k$, and observation $y(t)$ as $y_k$}{figure.2}{}}
